From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] attrib: several attributes and files, I O P U X V, not-resetting rules, errors (3530)

attrib: several attributes and files, I O P U X V, not-resetting rules, errors

attrib accumulates +/- attributes (+r +h worked only for the last one before), takes several file names, adds I O P U X V, refuses to change system/hidden files unless the command names the attribute (Not resetting ... file), reports access denied / file not found / bad parameter / invalid switch, accepts /L, and with /S /D recurses into folders.
---
--- a/programs/attrib/attrib.c
+++ b/programs/attrib/attrib.c
@@ -24,6 +24,17 @@
 
 WINE_DEFAULT_DEBUG_CHANNEL(attrib);
 
+#ifndef FILE_ATTRIBUTE_PINNED
+#define FILE_ATTRIBUTE_PINNED   0x00080000
+#define FILE_ATTRIBUTE_UNPINNED 0x00100000
+#endif
+#ifndef FILE_ATTRIBUTE_NO_SCRUB_DATA
+#define FILE_ATTRIBUTE_NO_SCRUB_DATA 0x00020000
+#endif
+#ifndef FILE_ATTRIBUTE_INTEGRITY_STREAM
+#define FILE_ATTRIBUTE_INTEGRITY_STREAM 0x00008000
+#endif
+
 /* =========================================================================
  * Load a string from the resource file, handling any error
